    excerpt:
      "Truth is not enough in the Intelligent Age, because AI models don’t “know” what truth is. AI Assemblages function by predicting patterns and harmonising text rather than consulting reality.",
    date: "2026-07-04",
    topic: "Critical Theory in AI",
