      "Data centres and hyperscale cloud infrastructure are the new victims of war. Hyperscale cloud infrastructure offers unparalleled, rapid scalability for immense computing, storage, and networking demands. Managed by industry leaders such as AWS, Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud, and Oracle Cloud, these architectures can dynamically scale resources on demand.",
