      "Twenty-nine regional offices and data centres operated by Amazon, IBM, Nvidia, Google, and Palantir have been explicitly targeted as legitimate military targets on Iran’s IRG Telegram Channel. Notably, Palantir, which develops the data architecture for the Pentagon’s Project Maven, is headquartered in Abu Dhabi.",
